L1: VITADIAL “Does correction of 25 OH-VITAmin D with cholecalciferol supplementation increase muscle strength in hemoDIALysis patients?”: study protocol for a randomized controlled trial
L2: Trials (2021)
L3: Stanislas Bataille, Nathalie Pedinielli, Elisa Carreno, Mathilde Prezelin-Reydit, Philippe Chauveau, Guillaume Jean, Thomas Robert, Mickaël Bobot, Guillaume Seret, Elisabeth Jouve, Frederic Lavainne, Marianne Serveaux, Laurence Vrigneaud, Stéphanie Gentile
